<title>UK: Council of Europe sets 200 bln lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets 200 bln lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE SOCIAL DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.50 PCT  MATURITY    25.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.835   PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
